Package: whispaste
Version: __VERSION__
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Silvio Lindstedt <silvio-lindstedt@outlook.com>
Homepage: https://whispaste.de/
Depends: libgtk-3-0, libsecret-1-0, libnotify4, libayatana-appindicator3-1, libasound2, libcurl4, libkeybinder-3.0-0, liblzma5, libc6, zlib1g
Description: Voice-input tool — hotkey, speak, paste anywhere
 WhisPaste is a voice-input tool. Press a global hotkey, speak, and the
 transcribed text is pasted at the cursor position of whatever application
 you are currently typing in — system-wide, not bound to a single app.
 .
 Transcription runs locally on your device via whisper.cpp (no network
 traffic) or, optionally, through a cloud provider you choose. The local
 Sprachdienst (whisper-server) is downloaded automatically on first use into
 the user's writable config dir ($XDG_CONFIG_HOME/whispaste, default
 ~/.config/whispaste); audio never leaves your device in local mode.
